You are welcome to reuse individual code snippets or build upon this
project, including in your own projects, under the MIT terms above.
Retain the copyright and permission notices in copies or substantial
portions of the Software, as required by that license. Third-party assets
remain subject to the rights described in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

When developing with AI assistance, please maintain a layer of human
supervision: a person should understand and review generated or modified
code, test its behavior, and assess its dependencies and impact before
publishing or distributing it. AI output should not be accepted without
human review. The developer remains responsible for their changes.

This note expresses the author's development guidance. It does not add
